      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy to keep trying to find ground. everything is just so loud and constant and draining. there's something so peaceful about the idea of just... letting go of the tether. like if i just stopped fighting the current and let the nothingness take me, i wouldn't have to feel this weight anymore. it feels more natural than trying to stay afloat.\n Fer",
